    "detailed_description": "<br><br>Gardening is one of life\u2019s simplest pleasures, and there are few things more satisfying than watching a plant grow from a tiny seedling to a blooming plant. Pocket Oasis brings that joy to life in a beautiful, hand-painted world.<br><br>Take a deep, relaxing breath and step out onto your very own balcony in a city of your choice. Choose from a wide variety of plants and decorations as you build your own little pocket oasis.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Relax in a hand crafted 2.5D balcony simulation with casual gameplay to unwind<br></li><li> Decorate 3 balconies in stunning cities around the world with hand-painted watercolors<br></li><li> 36 plants to unlock each with their own fruit to grow, harvest, and turn into jam<br></li><li> Name and repot your plants with up to 36 unlockable pots<br></li><li> 36 bespoke decorations to give each balcony a personal touch<br></li><li> A day and night cycle that impacts plant stats<br></li><li> Real-life geographical, weather, and climate data backend</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plants</h2>Design a garden that\u2019s entirely your own - With a wide selection of fruit bushes, vegetables and herbs, you have complete control over what you choose to grow in your garden. Decorate your balcony as you see fit - this is your little oasis.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348830/extras/88658e9b13e0278edc51d099116a5a70.poster.avif?t=1717831280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348830/extras/88658e9b13e0278edc51d099116a5a70.webm?t=1717831280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348830/extras/88658e9b13e0278edc51d099116a5a70.mp4?t=1717831280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harvest Fruit</h2>Transform your balcony into a true masterpiece with vibrant colours and deliciously drawn fruit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pets</h2>Unlock up to 20 of your very own pets to roam around on your balcony.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348830/extras/92ee84547e8dddaf69b705d6e689bdf1.poster.avif?t=1717831280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348830/extras/92ee84547e8dddaf69b705d6e689bdf1.webm?t=1717831280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348830/extras/92ee84547e8dddaf69b705d6e689bdf1.mp4?t=1717831280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cities</h2>Discover gardens around the globe - Grow sunflowers in Switzerland, roses in Rome, or figs in France - explore cities across Europe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348830/extras/53317aea5911e3d409caa2d5133dfb38.poster.avif?t=1717831280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348830/extras/53317aea5911e3d409caa2d5133dfb38.webm?t=1717831280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348830/extras/53317aea5911e3d409caa2d5133dfb38.mp4?t=1717831280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weather</h2>Influenced by real-life weather - Pocket Oasis takes data from the real world and brings it into the game, mirroring the weather and seasons of each city with its real-life counterpart.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand Painted</h2>Beautiful, hand-painted water colours - Every flower, creature, object and backdrop has been carefully painted by hand.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348830/extras/6c01ba4b90c82babae91d2250bd217d7.avif?t=1717831280\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Audio</h2>Original scoring from composer Tom Jensen.",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br>Gardening is one of life\u2019s simplest pleasures, and there are few things more satisfying than watching a plant grow from a tiny seedling to a blooming plant. Pocket Oasis brings that joy to life in a beautiful, hand-painted world.<br><br>Take a deep, relaxing breath and step out onto your very own balcony in a city of your choice. Choose from a wide variety of plants and decorations as you build your own little pocket oasis.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Relax in a hand crafted 2.5D balcony simulation with casual gameplay to unwind<br></li><li> Decorate 3 balconies in stunning cities around the world with hand-painted watercolors<br></li><li> 36 plants to unlock each with their own fruit to grow, harvest, and turn into jam<br></li><li> Name and repot your plants with up to 36 unlockable pots<br></li><li> 36 bespoke decorations to give each balcony a personal touch<br></li><li> A day and night cycle that impacts plant stats<br></li><li> Real-life geographical, weather, and climate data backend</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plants</h2>Design a garden that\u2019s entirely your own - With a wide selection of fruit bushes, vegetables and herbs, you have complete control over what you choose to grow in your garden. Decorate your balcony as you see fit - this is your little oasis.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348830/extras/88658e9b13e0278edc51d099116a5a70.poster.avif?t=1717831280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348830/extras/88658e9b13e0278edc51d099116a5a70.webm?t=1717831280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348830/extras/88658e9b13e0278edc51d099116a5a70.mp4?t=1717831280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harvest Fruit</h2>Transform your balcony into a true masterpiece with vibrant colours and deliciously drawn fruit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pets</h2>Unlock up to 20 of your very own pets to roam around on your balcony.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348830/extras/92ee84547e8dddaf69b705d6e689bdf1.poster.avif?t=1717831280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348830/extras/92ee84547e8dddaf69b705d6e689bdf1.webm?t=1717831280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348830/extras/92ee84547e8dddaf69b705d6e689bdf1.mp4?t=1717831280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cities</h2>Discover gardens around the globe - Grow sunflowers in Switzerland, roses in Rome, or figs in France - explore cities across Europe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348830/extras/53317aea5911e3d409caa2d5133dfb38.poster.avif?t=1717831280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348830/extras/53317aea5911e3d409caa2d5133dfb38.webm?t=1717831280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348830/extras/53317aea5911e3d409caa2d5133dfb38.mp4?t=1717831280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weather</h2>Influenced by real-life weather - Pocket Oasis takes data from the real world and brings it into the game, mirroring the weather and seasons of each city with its real-life counterpart.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand Painted</h2>Beautiful, hand-painted water colours - Every flower, creature, object and backdrop has been carefully painted by hand.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img